---
name: Reduce HarfangLab OCSF events for a SIEM
description: |
  Drains the Splunk pull export of a HarfangLab Manager every minute and
  reduces the volume of the OCSF events: network and HTTP activity become
  summaries, process starts and module loads become deduplicated events, and
  all other events pass through unchanged.
---

every 1min {
  harfanglab::fetch "https://example.hurukai.io:8443",
    token=secret("harfanglab-api-token")
}
harfanglab::ocsf::reduce
